{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_029_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c2b2ed07bce59189edc8a5818f30ec742f6b6fba499b07b87c0d893138e7e18c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000009:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48b2c93375123b586065f931665d6e4568c34945c2933053233b5e40f384dbe3",
      "text": "我家孩子给您添麻烦了，\n实在是非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6046264ff3d2689a2e21d929e534f69c75c0306bf700a665e3b41be85ad523d1",
      "text": "哪里，请别介意。\n妈妈来接你了，太好了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:579332ce77b33a3dc7180cae5389a4621f9162cdae0b0db7a39e3c3606c6efa4",
      "text": "嗯！大哥哥，拜拜——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e0c1f9f63867f0b67672128658ad75a04a52d5983672c09ceea0b7e9fed13ef",
      "text": "别了，幼小之人啊！\n切莫再次松开温暖之人的手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4174110c533a064e350ad2d54b3d3756f2d550044147b4757e7b63b045d1246",
      "text": "……容吾重新致谢。\n吾主，汝之救济，吾由衷感激。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2b3b5f08db5b684836ddec86280bd62d75a75ca0bdbd400a37a156eb36c1b7c",
      "text": "哪里，多亏阿斯兰先生保护了他，\n那个孩子才能和妈妈团聚呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7b1517530db053853080c24a05fe4a5a4a1dd5eb9b123e4f96d96dbacf407aa",
      "text": "……对幼小之人而言，至亲乃伟岸之存在。\n若与之离散，自是会不安难耐……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97abffba5633f98f91b3765ffa3f8f16a6cd04b84aa0bd714a807aedb6202985",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b5f49ad39ebd4f6f44accd0b67329623a3c22e0e69c45b61d176b0bee53272c",
      "text": "没、无甚大碍。\n那么……吾便重新出门采办食粮吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d414e654e09a1f5343a17abd6795afd1b98cd8902c545622685455a01c3a7b4",
      "text": "是去采购食材对吧？\n我也来帮忙，阿斯兰先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba2280064aaf5f085b2d51f3f36c4443699af6298a138c8fc87711700c2e70dd",
      "text": "感激不尽。吾主●●●●●●●●●●。\n来吧，同去将至上之供物收入囊中！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
